! mcp_bootstrap_p269.strap -- MCP printed page 269: JOB CONTROL, PHASE
! 4, OVERLAPPED, its opening (YJC4TT DD .. the dump/command/debug/EOJ/
! reload table EXTs), lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.20, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID QA000001  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 269".  The heading
! row's LOCATION field is BLANK (line 1 is a banner).
! A NEW CARD DECK: this page's serials start at QA000001.  No TAIL card
! on the page.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  Lines
! 1-3 and 13 are remark cards (banner, heading).  Line 4 "SLC,$" prints
! 231136.00 with a "*"; line 5 CNOP prints no location (231136.00
! already a word: emits nothing).  The EXT cards (lines 8, 43, 46, 49,
! 52, 55) print no location; each owns the statement after it.
! Located rows run contiguous from 231136.00 to 231171.00 (line 56, the
! 28-bit EXT(0,27) of BE,YRESL1, ending at 231171.34), then blank
! paper.  "*" after the LOCATION on lines 4, 7, 10, 25 and 42.
!   line 6   YJC4TT DD(BU,12,3),(8)0401 prints "C401" = 0401 (12 bits).
!   line 7   DR(BU,33),(1) at 231136.14 prints 000000.41 (the size).
!   lines 8-9 EXT(0,18) over B,YC4NO prints 0463203 at 231136.55.
!   line 10  DR(BU),(2) at 231137.00 prints 000002.00.
!   lines 11-12 YPPMEM / YMAX SYN print "020000.00+ +00000000 NULL" and
!            "030000.00+ +00000000 NULL".
!   line 24  (AX)DD(BU,12,6),22X at 231150.00 prints no binary.
!   line 25  YFHTA DR(BU,52),(1) at 231150.14 prints 000000.64.
!   lines 43-56 five EXT(0,27)/BE/(AX)DD triples: each EXT(0,27) takes
!            bits 0..27 (28 bits) of a BE half word, so the row prints
!            10 octal digits (a 1-bit digit then nine): 0471611000 etc.;
!            the (AX)DD rows at .34 print no binary.  Labels YDMPTA,
!            YCMDTA, YDBTA, YEOJTA, YRLTA sit on the EXT cards; the XW
!            rows 37-41 print their values 231165.00 .. 231171.00.
!            Line 51 is (AX)DD(BU,48,6) but its datum "$DUMP " is six
!            characters (36 bits); the page prints the next location
!            231170.00, confirming strap_asm's rule that a converted
!            DD's size is character count x byte size, not the 48.
! JOIN.  p.268 is not landed and no neighbour deck exists -- contiguity
! with it is NOT established here (the page opens on SLC,$).  Landed
! p.121 SYNs YJC4TT at (8)231136.00, which this page's line 6 defines
! there -- an independent witness of the origin.  p.270 should open at
! 231171.34 (line 56's EXT ends there; presumably the (AX)DD of the
! YRLTA triple) with serial QA000051.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * YEOJTA (operand line 40, label line 52): reads "YECJTA" at 400
!     dpi; at 1800 dpi the line-52 glyph after E has a RIGHT-hand stroke
!     (open at the bottom, as this drum's O prints; a C opens on the
!     right) and matches the O of line 54's "$EOJ".  Also: the (AX) data two
!     rows below the label reads "$EOJ", the XW that uses it is labelled
!     YXWEJM (E-J, end of job), and its four siblings are named for
!     their (AX) text (YDMPTA/$DUMP, YCMDTA/SCOMD, YDBTA, YRLTA).  The
!     name is used only on this page; no landed deck spells it.
!   * YFDO (line 22): third glyph has the D stem, fourth is round with
!     no stem -> O.  Unreferenced on this page.
!   * JCOMD (line 47): "JCCMD" to tesseract; the third glyph is the
!     drum's open round glyph, taken as O to match the (AX) text "SCOMD"
!     below it.  No landed deck spells it.  Value from this page's EXT
!     binary (half word only).
!   * YC4NO (line 9): final glyph round, no stem; O (the family is
!     letters).  Value from the EXT binary.
!   * line 48 (AX) text "SCOMD X": its first glyph prints as an S with
!     no vertical stroke at 900 dpi, unlike the "$" of lines 45, 51 and
!     54.  Written as printed (S).  Character data; prints no binary.
!   * hex bytes and octal fields printed with an open round written 0
!     ("DC"/"DO" line 17 = D0; "1C" line 16 = 10; "C0"/"CO" lines 30, 36
!     = 00; "C1" line 32 = 01; "CCO" XW flag fields = 000).
!   * DFETCH (line 23): landed p.105 "DFETCH SYN, 66.32"; prints
!     000102.40 = 66.32 decimal.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Values for symbols defined on pages not landed come from
! this page's binary (half word only unless said).  EXT(0,27) rows give
! the 19-bit half-word address in the top 19 of 28 bits.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QA000001 .. QA000050; each EXT and its statement share
! one serial (lines 8-9 QA000008, 43-44 QA000042, 46-47 QA000044, 49-50
! QA000046, 52-53 QA000048, 55-56 QA000050).  None skipped.

DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108 "D MCP SYN,32.0"; B line 22 000040.10
DFETCH  SYN, 66.32                   ! landed p.105 line 36 "D FETCH"; line 23 000102.40
XNFOST  SYN, (8)234212.40            ! not landed; SV line 33 234212.43, half word only
CBUFF   SYN, (8)234214.0             ! not landed; Z line 34 234214.22, half word only
CFOT    SYN, (8)234220.0             ! not landed; Z line 35 234220.22, half word only
YMPBUF  SYN, (8)234424.0             ! not landed; XW count field lines 37-39, 41 prints 234424 (word only)
YC4NO   SYN, (8)231501.40            ! not landed; EXT(0,18) line 9 prints 0463203, half word only
AWDUMP  SYN, (8)234704.40            ! not landed; EXT(0,27) line 44 prints 0471611000, half word only
JCOMD   SYN, (8)234443.0             ! not landed; EXT(0,27) line 47 prints 0471106000, half word only
YDBBEG  SYN, (8)234424.0             ! not landed; EXT(0,27) line 50 prints 0471050000, half word only
YRESL1  SYN, (8)235262.0             ! not landed; EXT(0,27) line 56 prints 0472544000, half word only

        SLC, (8)231136.00
! line  1  -*************************************************************
! line  2  - JOB CONTROL, PHASE 4, -OVERLAPPED
! line  3  -*************************************************************
        SLC,$                                                ! line  4  prints 231136.00 *
        CNOP                                                 ! line  5  (no location printed)
YJC4TT  DD(BU,12,3),(8)0401                                  ! line  6
        DR(BU,33),(1)                                        ! line  7
        EXT(0,18)                                            ! line  8
        B,YC4NO                                              ! line  9
        DR(BU),(2)                                           ! line 10
YPPMEM  SYN,(8)20000.                                        ! line 11
YMAX    SYN,(8)30000.                                        ! line 12  -UPPER END OF JC4 WHILE IN CORE
! line 13  - SPECIAL PACKAGE TO PULL MCP PROGRAMS FROM THE DISK.
YMPFCH  SC,1,YFHFWA                                          ! line 14
        LF(BU,36),.28($1)                                    ! line 15
        KF(BU,36),YMPSAV                                     ! line 16
        ST(BU,36),YMPSAV                                     ! line 17
        LV,$1,0($1)                                          ! line 18
        SVA,$1,YFHBR                                         ! line 19
        BAE,YFHBR                                            ! line 20
        SF(BU,36),YFHTA                                      ! line 21
YFDO    B,DMCP                                               ! line 22
        ,DFETCH                                              ! line 23
        (AX)DD(BU,12,6),22X                                  ! line 24
YFHTA   DR(BU,52),(1)                                        ! line 25
        ,0                                                   ! line 26
YFHFWA  ,0                                                   ! line 27
        ,0                                                   ! line 28
        ,0                                                   ! line 29
        BEW,$                                                ! line 30
        NOP                                                  ! line 31
        LVI,1,0                                              ! line 32
        SV,1,XNFOST                                          ! line 33
        Z,CBUFF                                              ! line 34
        Z,CFOT                                               ! line 35
YFHBR   B,$                                                  ! line 36
YXWDMP  XW,YDMPTA,YMPBUF,0,0                                 ! line 37
YXWCMD  XW,YCMDTA,YMPBUF,0,0                                 ! line 38
YXWDB   XW,YDBTA,YMPBUF,0,0                                  ! line 39
YXWEJM  XW,YEOJTA,YPPMEM                                     ! line 40  printed "YECJTA"
YXWRLD  XW,YRLTA,YMPBUF                                      ! line 41
YMPSAV  XW,0                                                 ! line 42
YDMPTA  EXT(0,27)                                            ! line 43
        BE,AWDUMP                                            ! line 44
        (AX)DD(BU,36,6),$DUMP X                              ! line 45
YCMDTA  EXT(0,27)                                            ! line 46
        BE,JCOMD                                             ! line 47
        (AX)DD(BU,36,6),SCOMD X                              ! line 48
YDBTA   EXT(0,27)                                            ! line 49
        BE,YDBBEG                                            ! line 50
        (AX)DD(BU,48,6),$DUMP X                              ! line 51
YEOJTA  EXT(0,27)                                            ! line 52  printed "YECJTA"
        BE,YPPMEM                                            ! line 53
        (AX)DD(BU,36,6),$EOJ  X                              ! line 54
YRLTA   EXT(0,27)                                            ! line 55
        BE,YRESL1                                            ! line 56

